              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zimene Ambuye akunena kwa ine ndi izi: \"Chaka chimodzi chisanathe, potsata mmene amawerengera munthu waganyu, ulemerero wonse wa Kedara udzatheratu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.16",
